- id: '2097205829141205220'
  text: '[OpenSource - AI Agent Skills & Generative 3D]


    Prompting an AI to build a 3D game usually results in basic, unpolished graphics
    that look nothing like modern AAA titles. 🛑


    dream-loop by @anshuc is an open-source agent skill that fixes this by giving
    your AI the ability to "dream" up high-quality visuals and autonomously iterate
    on its code until the game matches that vision.


    Here is how this closed-loop visual critic system works. 🧵👇


    1/4'
