- id: '2097205957889556486'
  text: "Stop accepting unpolished prototype graphics from your coding agents:\n\n\
    • Target Image Generation: The agent first \"dreams\" up a high-fidelity target\
    \ screenshot of what the scene should look like using its internal image generation\
    \ capabilities. \n• Iterative Building: The primary agent then writes the rendering\
    \ code (e.g., using Three.js) trying to replicate that exact visual target. \n\
    • Sub-Agent Critic: A secondary vision-enabled AI critic continuously compares\
    \ the live, compiled screenshot to the original \"dreamed\" target, providing\
    \ feedback and forcing the agent to loop until the scene reaches AAA quality.\
    \ \U0001F916\U0001F3A8\n\n2/4"
